PICS 0
BACnet Protocol Implementation Conformance Statement
Vendor Name: "Chipkin Automation Systems"
Product Name: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-LD"
Product Model Number: "CAS BACnet Stack Example - B-LD"
Product Description: "A BACnet/IP luminaire built on the CAS BACnet Stack. It presents one commandable Lighting Output whose level is driven by both a 16-slot Priority_Array and the constructed Lighting_Command SEQUENCE. Every operation of Table 12-67 is carried out over time - fades over their fade time, ramps at their ramp rate, warns wait out Egress_Time - with Tracking_Value, In_Progress and Egress_Active reporting it; the lamp and dimming driver are a labelled Simulation. Plus DeviceCommunicationControl and local TimeSynchronization. It answers ReadProperty and WriteProperty for every required property of every object, and is discoverable by Who-Is / I-Am and Who-Has / I-Have. It is a tutorial for implementers of the B-LD profile."

BACnet Standardized Device Profiles Supported:
{
B-LD - BACnet Lighting Device
}

BIBBs Supported:
{
DS-RP-B
DS-WP-B
DM-DDB-B
DM-DOB-B
DM-DCC-B
DS-LO-B
DM-TS-B
}

BACnet Standard Application Services Supported:
{
ReadProperty Execute
WriteProperty Execute
DeviceCommunicationControl Execute
IAm Initiate
IHave Initiate
TimeSynchronization Execute
WhoHas Execute
WhoIs Execute
}

Standard Object Types Supported:
{
Device
Lighting Output
Network Port
}

Data Link Layer Option:
{
BACnet IP, (Annex J)
}

